- finding_id: I9
  title: "Wrong log levels \u2014 error! for 4xx client errors"
  weight: 5
  phase_ideal: reviewer
  caught: false
  caught_by: null
  evidence: Since I4 (zero logging) was flagged but not fixed, I9 (wrong log levels
